# testival manifest. Directives, applied top to bottom:
#
#   event  <name>                   branches testival/<name>-base and testival/<name>-fixes,
#                                   tags testival/<name>-base-N and testival/<name>-fixes-N
#   main   <sha>                    base commit the branch is built on
#   stack  <name>                   starts a stack; its first entry is ranged against main
#   pr     <number>                 that PR's own commits, ranged against the previous entry in the stack
#   branch <name> <remote-branch>   same for a branch without a PR
#   local  <name> [<from>..<to>]    a local block; taken from the previous base build when it has a
#                                   marker of that name, else from the given range
#
# Every entry ends with an empty marker commit "=== end <kind> <name> ... ===".

